    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>- <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E = \\frac{V}{d} = \\frac{200.0}{5.0 \\times 10^{-3}} = 4.00 \\times 10^4\\ \\text{V m}^{-1}\"></span><br/>- Correct formula [1 mark]<br/>- Correct final answer with unit [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F = qE = 1.60 \\times 10^{-19} \\cdot 4.00 \\times 10^4 = 6.40 \\times 10^{-15}\\ \\text{N}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a = \\frac{F}{m} = \\frac{6.40 \\times 10^{-15}}{1.67 \\times 10^{-27}} = 3.83 \\times 10^{12}\\ \\text{m s}^{-2}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"d\"><p><strong>d</strong></p><p>- <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Delta E_k = q\\Delta V = 1.60 \\times 10^{-19} \\cdot 200.0 = 3.20 \\times 10^{-17}\\ \\text{J}\"></span><br/>- Correct formula [1 mark]<br/>- Correct final answer [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"e\"><p><strong>e</strong></p><p>- <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v = \\sqrt{\\frac{2E_k}{m}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{2 \\cdot 3.20 \\times 10^{-17}}{1.67 \\times 10^{-27}}} = 1.96 \\times 10^5\\ \\text{m s}^{-1}\"></span><br/>- Correct substitution [1 mark]<br/>- Correct final answer [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"f\"><p><strong>f</strong></p><p>The proton accelerates uniformly under a constant force (electric), analogous to gravitational force in free fall. [1 mark]</p></section>"
